<title>POLAND: PETROBANK SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>PETROBANK SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.77 vs    2.00</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.21 vs    0.18</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  2.83 vs    2.50</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 5.43 vs    4.54</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  5.35 vs    9.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    8.65 vs   10.79</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 23.27 vs   25.08</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	48.49 vs   39.46</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Petrobank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
